### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create registro (requires valid JWT token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Pérez García",
  "phone": "+573001234567",
  "identificationType": "Cédula de Ciudadanía",
  "identificationNumber": "123456789",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "address": "Calle 1 #2-3, Barrio Centro",
  "ageGroup": "25-35",
  "department": "Casanare",
  "municipality": "Yopal",
  "gender": "Male",
  "acceptedTerms": true
}

### Get registros as Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
